### =====================================================
### Reset Password - POST /account/reset-password
### Cambio de contraseña con código de verificación
### (anónimo, no requiere Authorization). El código de 6
### dígitos se obtiene previamente por email/SMS.
### =====================================================

### Test 1: Reset con código de verificación válido (happy path) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "newPassword": "MiNuevaPassword123",
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}

### Test 2: Código de verificación inválido o expirado — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "newPassword": "MiNuevaPassword123",
  "verificationCode": "000000",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}

### Test 3: Código con formato inválido (no son 6 dígitos) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "newPassword": "MiNuevaPassword123",
  "verificationCode": "ABC12",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}

### Test 4: Usuario inexistente — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario.inexistente.999999999",
  "email": "inexistente@ejemplo.com",
  "newPassword": "MiNuevaPassword123",
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}

### Test 5: Email que no coincide con el usuario — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "otro.email@ejemplo.com",
  "newPassword": "MiNuevaPassword123",
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}

### Test 6: Campo requerido faltante (sin newPassword) — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "email": "usuario@ejemplo.com",
  "verificationCode": "123456",
  "applicationIdentity": 21,
  "publicApi": "https://desarrollo.webtrack.online/api"
}
